			<title>Truth or Dare Fragrance: Madonna to take an intimate release party in New York!</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/712-truth-or-dare-fragrance-madonna-to-do-an-intimate-release-party-in-new-york.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/712-truth-or-dare-fragrance-madonna-to-do-an-intimate-release-party-in-new-york.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>The large bottle of <strong>Madonna</strong>'s <strong>Truth or Dare Fragrance</strong> comes with a copy of the standard "clean" version of MDNA. The perfume is selling like hot cakes, according to the sales rep, so this is also a good news for the album.</p>
<p>When you purchase the $150 gift set, you will receive a ticket to an  exclusive <strong>Madonna</strong> in-store appreance at the NYC Macy's in 34th st on April 12th, 2012. It will be an intimate release party.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>Thanks to our community member Merboy007.</p></div>]]></description>
